WEBVTT

00:00:25.630 --> 00:00:30.210
Machi is listening to
Soiya's music in the rain...

00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:37.320
I wonder if it was a bad day
at school or something.

00:00:40.280 --> 00:00:45.420
She does things like this
when she's had a bad day.

00:00:47.780 --> 00:00:51.030
Listening to Soiya in the rain...

00:00:51.980 --> 00:00:54.220
...makes me feel alive.

00:00:55.480 --> 00:00:56.730
That's what she said.

00:01:02.480 --> 00:01:03.680
The sound of rain...

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:07.080
...raindrops falling on me...

00:01:08.730 --> 00:01:10.930
...the rhythm of Soiya's music...

00:01:12.330 --> 00:01:14.530
...and my heartbeat join together...

00:01:17.880 --> 00:01:20.030
...and become one naturally.

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:35.490
You'll catch a cold like that, Machi.

00:01:40.830 --> 00:01:41.630
See?

00:01:41.630 --> 00:01:43.180
This is what happens when you do that.

00:03:23.300 --> 00:03:24.250
Ah-choo!

00:03:27.550 --> 00:03:29.640
Did something happen at school?

00:03:31.230 --> 00:03:31.950
Today...

00:03:32.500 --> 00:03:34.200
...I found out that everyone at school...

00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:37.710
...has that thing.

00:03:45.180 --> 00:03:46.280
Sorry!

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:47.830
I'm okay.

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:53.850
Shota, you dropped...
some... thing...

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:54.040
Shota-kun, you dropped... some... thing...

00:03:55.600 --> 00:03:57.600
Oops, my bad.

00:03:57.600 --> 00:03:59.630
I dropped my cell.

00:04:00.720 --> 00:04:01.800
Shota...

00:04:00.760 --> 00:04:01.840
Shota-kun...

00:04:02.420 --> 00:04:04.890
...I didn't know you had a cell phone.

00:04:04.890 --> 00:04:07.390
Well, all the kids today carry them.

00:04:07.770 --> 00:04:09.080
I don't get any reception, though!

00:04:10.410 --> 00:04:13.230
I'll ask for one when I enter high school.

00:04:13.820 --> 00:04:18.200
But isn't it hard for an elementary
school kid to make full use of it?

00:04:17.600 --> 00:04:18.200
Ah!

00:04:18.200 --> 00:04:19.570
You have got a cell!

00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:21.830
Cell phones are convenient, aren't they?

00:04:21.830 --> 00:04:23.450
I have one, too.

00:04:24.900 --> 00:04:27.340
My life got a lot easier.

00:04:28.190 --> 00:04:30.240
There's no reception, though.

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:32.600
What ringtone do you use?

00:04:32.600 --> 00:04:34.330
"I Want You Way Too Bad!"

00:04:36.350 --> 00:04:38.420
So Kaori has one, too...

00:04:38.800 --> 00:04:41.510
Elementary school kids are
precocious, aren't they?

00:05:06.750 --> 00:05:07.560
Tch.

00:05:07.560 --> 00:05:09.080
There's no reception.

00:05:09.650 --> 00:05:12.700
I guess I'll check all the ringtones it has.

00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:17.200
Therefore...

00:05:19.290 --> 00:05:20.780
...I want a cell phone!

00:05:26.540 --> 00:05:28.150
Even though you can't get any reception?

00:05:29.620 --> 00:05:31.160
But you do get some signal, right?

00:05:31.930 --> 00:05:33.990
Not even a bit, it's cruel.

00:05:35.580 --> 00:05:37.480
That's why I don't like the boonies.

00:05:41.650 --> 00:05:43.320
Say... Natsu...

00:05:44.130 --> 00:05:47.840
I really want to go to
high school in the city!

00:05:56.500 --> 00:05:57.920
Listen, Natsu!

00:06:00.450 --> 00:06:01.250
I...

00:06:01.750 --> 00:06:03.340
...gave it careful thought.

00:06:04.520 --> 00:06:08.840
If I continue to live a comfortable life
in this village being naive,

00:06:09.450 --> 00:06:13.600
I may not be able to live
outside of this village.

00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:16.250
That's how I feel.

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:20.020
So... Natsu...

00:06:20.850 --> 00:06:25.700
I think people should experience
all sorts of things even if they're pain—

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:26.570
Machi.

00:06:27.950 --> 00:06:29.800
What... is this is?!

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:36.700
Ahhh!

00:06:37.150 --> 00:06:39.150
That's a cell phone!

00:06:39.950 --> 00:06:40.900
That's right.

00:06:40.550 --> 00:06:42.400
It's a cell! It's a cell!

00:06:41.400 --> 00:06:42.700
It's a cell phone.

00:06:42.400 --> 00:06:43.600
Um, let me see!

00:06:43.600 --> 00:06:45.050
Let me touch it!

00:06:45.050 --> 00:06:46.800
What ringtone does it have?

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:47.500
What?

00:06:48.250 --> 00:06:49.590
Let's see...

00:06:51.980 --> 00:06:54.060
That's Skypée.

00:06:57.310 --> 00:06:58.430
It's from Yoshio!

00:07:00.060 --> 00:07:01.440
Hey, Natsu!

00:07:01.850 --> 00:07:03.750
I installed Skypée, too.

00:07:04.300 --> 00:07:07.490
I'm surprised that you could install it on
an old computer at the village office.

00:07:07.490 --> 00:07:11.820
I wish they would buy
new computers already!

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:14.200
The picture quality on
your end is pretty good.

00:07:14.650 --> 00:07:17.450
The rear camera has higher resolution.

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:19.830
Oh, Machi, you're back already!

00:07:19.700 --> 00:07:21.200
It was pouring, wasn't it?

00:07:21.200 --> 00:07:22.610
Did you get wet?

00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:24.250
Hello! Hello!

00:07:24.150 --> 00:07:25.600
It's me, Yoshio!

00:07:24.250 --> 00:07:26.090
It's me, Yoshio-kun!

00:07:29.340 --> 00:07:31.470
Now, Machi, why don't you talk to him?

00:07:32.290 --> 00:07:33.860
T-Talk?

00:07:33.860 --> 00:07:35.050
A-About what?

00:07:35.500 --> 00:07:36.850
What can I talk about?

00:07:35.900 --> 00:07:37.350
Hello! Hello!

00:07:39.750 --> 00:07:41.690
"It's a fine day today."

00:07:41.690 --> 00:07:43.230
It's raining.

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:45.730
Yoshio, did you get a screenie of that?

00:07:46.050 --> 00:07:46.820
Can I have it?

00:07:47.300 --> 00:07:48.230
Sure.

00:07:48.700 --> 00:07:53.110
By the way, how's the pressure rice cooker
I gave you the other day doing?

00:07:52.300 --> 00:07:54.800
Hey, what's a screenie?

00:07:53.110 --> 00:07:57.800
Yeah, but it's completely
become a decoration.

00:07:56.650 --> 00:07:58.500
Hey... Hey...

00:07:57.800 --> 00:07:59.760
Huh? Why?

00:07:59.760 --> 00:08:01.330
What's a screenie?

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:02.370
Hey!

00:08:02.370 --> 00:08:04.500
It means "screenshot."

00:08:05.350 --> 00:08:06.930
You liar!

00:08:06.930 --> 00:08:08.600
You do have reception!

00:08:09.220 --> 00:08:10.460
No, I don't.

00:08:12.810 --> 00:08:14.810
I'm using the Internet connection.

00:08:15.360 --> 00:08:18.640
The reception we don't have
is the cell phone signal.

00:08:20.320 --> 00:08:21.050
I see.

00:08:21.730 --> 00:08:24.810
Yoshio, Machi says she wants a cell phone.

00:08:24.770 --> 00:08:27.690
Yeah, I know, she's been talking about it.

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:29.990
It'll probably take a while
for her to get used to it,

00:08:29.990 --> 00:08:33.530
so it might be better if she gets it now
instead of when she enters high school.

00:08:36.070 --> 00:08:38.780
A city-kid quiz!

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:41.500
What is it?

00:08:42.040 --> 00:08:45.420
I'll ask you a question about cell phones.

00:08:45.800 --> 00:08:47.400
If you get it wrong,

00:08:47.400 --> 00:08:51.100
maybe I'll have you appear in events
as the village mascot girl.

00:08:51.700 --> 00:08:53.470
What's that got to do with anything?!

00:08:53.950 --> 00:08:55.750
Oh, you don't want a cell phone?

00:08:56.200 --> 00:08:57.590
That won't be a problem.

00:08:57.720 --> 00:08:59.680
I'll ask Natsu to give his to me.

00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:02.980
That one doesn't have a SIM card.

00:09:02.980 --> 00:09:05.310
Oh, that's the model I had before.

00:09:05.780 --> 00:09:08.860
You can't even call or text
without a SIM card, you know.

00:09:14.850 --> 00:09:16.750
S... Sin...

00:09:17.550 --> 00:09:18.350
...card...?

00:09:19.400 --> 00:09:20.830
SIM card.

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:22.330
Si... n?

00:09:22.800 --> 00:09:24.160
SIM.

00:09:25.900 --> 00:09:27.450
Here's the question.

00:09:28.800 --> 00:09:32.650
Among these six items,
which one is a cellphone?

00:09:35.170 --> 00:09:36.380
Yoshio...

00:09:36.380 --> 00:09:39.930
That's a little too much of an insult to Machi.

00:09:41.000 --> 00:09:43.650
Normally, the answer would be
number three, right?

00:09:46.650 --> 00:09:47.500
But...

00:09:50.050 --> 00:09:52.000
...one of them is food!

00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:55.300
The correct one is...

00:09:56.150 --> 00:09:57.650
...raw morokoshi?!

00:09:58.250 --> 00:09:59.420
Number three!

00:09:59.420 --> 00:10:01.490
You were right about number three!

00:10:02.500 --> 00:10:04.100
What's your final answer?

00:10:16.700 --> 00:10:17.680
Yesh...

00:10:19.250 --> 00:10:21.130
Correct!

00:10:21.130 --> 00:10:27.060
Since you got it right, I'll give you this
cell phone that I just purchased today!

00:10:27.400 --> 00:10:27.980
Huh...?

00:10:28.450 --> 00:10:31.220
It's the latest model in a popular color!

00:10:31.220 --> 00:10:33.500
What?! What?!

00:10:33.770 --> 00:10:35.570
I'm happy for you, Machi.

00:10:33.800 --> 00:10:35.570
What?!

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:38.550
I'm going home now, so I'll
drop by and give it to you.

00:11:03.680 --> 00:11:05.810
Here, take this, Machi!

00:11:05.680 --> 00:11:07.000
It's yours!

00:11:22.950 --> 00:11:24.350
It's dazzling!

00:11:25.300 --> 00:11:26.400
Ahh!

00:11:26.400 --> 00:11:28.850
The light of civilization is dazzling!

00:11:29.300 --> 00:11:31.550
I wonder how long she will be like that.

00:11:32.050 --> 00:11:34.350
I hope she will calm down in three days or so.

00:11:42.400 --> 00:11:43.540
Wow!

00:11:43.540 --> 00:11:46.120
Your cell is so cute, Machi!

00:11:43.540 --> 00:11:46.120
Your cell is so cute, Machi-chan!

00:11:46.120 --> 00:11:47.500
That's a new model!

00:11:47.500 --> 00:11:48.460
Lucky you!

00:11:48.460 --> 00:11:50.050
That's so cool!

00:11:50.050 --> 00:11:51.950
Oh, not really.

00:11:57.500 --> 00:11:58.800
Sleepy...

00:11:59.750 --> 00:12:03.450
I'll probably be facing a barrage
of questions every day now.

00:12:04.280 --> 00:12:06.700
But Machi looked happy.

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:09.900
What do you use for the ringtone?

00:12:10.400 --> 00:12:12.000
Greensleeves.

00:12:13.950 --> 00:12:15.460
Cool!

00:12:31.750 --> 00:12:32.400
Well...

00:12:32.850 --> 00:12:34.700
...we get no reception, though.

00:13:02.120 --> 00:13:03.020
Shhh!

00:13:13.560 --> 00:13:17.150
Hey, please, Machi!

00:13:17.020 --> 00:13:18.610
There's no way I'm doing that!

00:13:21.110 --> 00:13:23.110
I can't become an idol!

00:13:23.570 --> 00:13:25.700
That's not true!

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:27.360
It's true!

00:13:27.360 --> 00:13:28.310
Oh...

00:13:28.310 --> 00:13:30.550
You'll be fine!

00:13:30.550 --> 00:13:32.920
You're cute and have a nice figure.

00:13:32.920 --> 00:13:34.370
You're a good singer, too!

00:13:34.370 --> 00:13:35.870
Liar!

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:39.710
Welcome home, Machi...

00:13:40.540 --> 00:13:41.670
...and Yoshio.

00:13:42.380 --> 00:13:44.550
I'm home, Natsu...

00:13:46.810 --> 00:13:47.860
Hibiki?

00:13:46.810 --> 00:13:47.860
Hibiki-chan?

00:13:48.890 --> 00:13:49.970
Shhh!

00:13:50.970 --> 00:13:51.970
Shhh!

00:13:52.720 --> 00:13:55.040
She stopped by earlier and fell asleep.

00:13:55.040 --> 00:13:55.670
I see.

00:13:55.770 --> 00:13:57.480
Hey, Machi!

00:13:57.370 --> 00:13:58.970
Please!

00:13:58.970 --> 00:14:00.400
Shut up!

00:14:00.400 --> 00:14:03.720
I need to take your pictures
for ads before the day is over!

00:14:03.720 --> 00:14:05.530
It's not my problem!

00:14:05.530 --> 00:14:08.070
So you don't care if I'm
scolded by Manager?!

00:14:08.070 --> 00:14:08.700
I don't!

00:14:09.470 --> 00:14:13.170
Anyway, you can just
change into this outfit.

00:14:13.170 --> 00:14:13.920
No!

00:14:13.920 --> 00:14:15.820
Now, stop being so selfish!

00:14:15.820 --> 00:14:17.320
Take off your clothes! Take off!

00:14:16.220 --> 00:14:17.540
No!

00:14:17.540 --> 00:14:18.670
No!

00:14:19.620 --> 00:14:20.520
Ow, ow, ow...

00:14:20.630 --> 00:14:22.420
Stop fighting me, Machi!

00:14:22.320 --> 00:14:23.120
You dummy, dummy!

00:14:23.120 --> 00:14:24.620
Yoshio, I hate you!

00:14:23.120 --> 00:14:24.800
Yoshio-kun, I hate you!

00:14:28.550 --> 00:14:32.220
To Yoshio, Machi is like his daughter...

00:14:32.720 --> 00:14:34.220
...or actually more like a pet.

00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:37.720
I know that he's doing it purely
for the sake of the village

00:14:37.720 --> 00:14:40.320
and he has no ulterior motive...

00:14:43.410 --> 00:14:47.340
But I can't let others see this situation.

00:14:55.680 --> 00:14:58.770
I completely fell asleep,
you stupid bear!

00:14:59.320 --> 00:15:00.220
I'm going home!

00:15:00.970 --> 00:15:01.770
Geez...

00:15:02.460 --> 00:15:03.090
Huh?

00:15:04.250 --> 00:15:05.630
Hibiki, you got it wrong!

00:15:05.630 --> 00:15:06.920
D-D-Don't call the—!

00:15:07.370 --> 00:15:08.020
Ow!

00:15:08.340 --> 00:15:09.470
Ouch!

00:15:09.470 --> 00:15:10.430
Hibiki?!

00:15:10.420 --> 00:15:11.550
You were here?

00:15:11.550 --> 00:15:12.680
You perv!

00:15:13.070 --> 00:15:13.850
Huh?

00:15:13.850 --> 00:15:16.520
She's already a middle school student!

00:15:16.520 --> 00:15:18.850
You can't dress and undress
her like she's a puppy!

00:15:18.850 --> 00:15:22.100
Seriously, if anyone else saw this,
they would think you were a complete sicko!

00:15:22.100 --> 00:15:22.730
Huh?

00:15:23.190 --> 00:15:24.940
She's not a little kid anymore!

00:15:25.250 --> 00:15:30.450
But I still need to have her change
and take her pictures for ads.

00:15:26.770 --> 00:15:27.820
Hibiki...

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:27.940
Hibiki...

00:15:28.320 --> 00:15:30.450
So you do understand...

00:15:30.450 --> 00:15:32.320
That's a childhood friend for you.

00:15:30.450 --> 00:15:32.320
And as the village mascot girl,

00:15:32.320 --> 00:15:35.740
she will be appearing in many events, so...

00:15:36.820 --> 00:15:37.970
What's with him?

00:15:38.820 --> 00:15:40.420
What the hell is he talking about?

00:15:40.970 --> 00:15:41.790
Ah!

00:15:42.320 --> 00:15:44.770
Then you can be her manager, Hiiko!

00:15:45.820 --> 00:15:46.470
Huh?

00:15:47.420 --> 00:15:48.620
That's a good idea!

00:15:49.260 --> 00:15:54.850
I've always thought that
Machi needs to be around girls.

00:15:55.430 --> 00:15:56.720
What?

00:15:56.720 --> 00:15:58.970
What are you guys talking about?

00:15:58.970 --> 00:16:00.430
Manager?

00:16:00.810 --> 00:16:05.480
Well, you'll feel reassured if Hibiki
is with you, right, Machi?

00:16:06.650 --> 00:16:08.690
If Hibiki becomes your manager...

00:16:08.940 --> 00:16:11.700
...we may be able to
hook her up with Yoshio...

00:16:12.070 --> 00:16:14.450
...and you can be friends with her, too!

00:16:17.200 --> 00:16:18.040
I see.

00:16:18.370 --> 00:16:20.950
If Hibiki becomes my manager,

00:16:18.370 --> 00:16:20.950
If Hibiki-chan becomes my manager,

00:16:20.950 --> 00:16:23.920
she may be able to get close to Yoshio...

00:16:20.950 --> 00:16:23.960
she may be able to get close to Yoshio-kun...

00:16:24.770 --> 00:16:27.220
And I can be friends with Hibiki, too!

00:16:24.770 --> 00:16:27.220
And I can be friends with Hibiki-chan, too!

00:16:31.120 --> 00:16:34.480
Really, I think this outfit is strange.

00:16:34.480 --> 00:16:36.020
It's not strange! It's not!

00:16:36.470 --> 00:16:39.970
I somehow got dragged into this.

00:16:42.620 --> 00:16:46.310
Hey, I really think this outfit is strange.

00:16:46.750 --> 00:16:48.220
It's not strange!

00:16:48.220 --> 00:16:49.570
It's cute!

00:16:50.220 --> 00:16:53.570
No matter where you go,
no one will think it's strange!

00:16:54.070 --> 00:16:56.570
You look like a model, Machi.

00:16:59.970 --> 00:17:03.100
Hibiki, don't you think
this outfit is strange?

00:16:59.970 --> 00:17:03.100
Hibiki-chan, don't you think
this outfit is strange?

00:17:03.100 --> 00:17:04.210
Huh?

00:17:04.480 --> 00:17:07.460
I think it's probably fine.

00:17:07.970 --> 00:17:09.250
I see.

00:17:09.670 --> 00:17:12.720
You think it's probably fine... huh...?

00:17:14.550 --> 00:17:17.680
But I really think this outfit is strange.

00:17:17.680 --> 00:17:18.890
That's not true!

00:17:18.890 --> 00:17:20.220
Well, it's normal.

00:17:21.680 --> 00:17:23.180
I see...

00:17:23.180 --> 00:17:25.480
Well, if it's normal, then it's okay, huh...?

00:17:30.270 --> 00:17:31.980
It really is strange.

00:17:31.980 --> 00:17:33.490
Okay, ladies and gentlemen!

00:17:33.490 --> 00:17:35.280
Thank you for your patience!

00:17:37.110 --> 00:17:39.990
We're now commencing today's main event!

00:17:40.370 --> 00:17:44.720
Here is the Kumade Village mascot girl, Machi!

00:17:40.370 --> 00:17:44.620
Here is the Kumade Village mascot girl, Machi-chan!

00:17:44.620 --> 00:17:47.580
Yeeeeeaaaah! I'm getting fired up!

00:17:45.270 --> 00:17:47.420
We will follow you, Machi!

00:17:45.270 --> 00:17:47.420
We will follow you, Machi-chan!

00:17:47.580 --> 00:17:50.090
This is her debut stage!

00:17:50.090 --> 00:17:51.800
So she will do her best!

00:17:51.570 --> 00:17:52.270
Machi!

00:17:51.570 --> 00:17:52.270
Machi-chan!

00:17:52.270 --> 00:17:55.020
Machi is cute!

00:17:52.270 --> 00:17:55.020
Machi-chan is cute!

00:17:53.070 --> 00:17:55.270
Machi! Machi!

00:17:53.070 --> 00:17:55.270
Machi-chan! Machi-chan!

00:17:55.380 --> 00:17:55.920
Hey!

00:17:55.920 --> 00:17:57.880
We've been waiting for this!

00:17:57.880 --> 00:18:00.550
Well, first, we'll have a Q and A session.

00:18:00.800 --> 00:18:03.600
Machi-chan will answer any questions.

00:18:00.920 --> 00:18:03.470
Machi will answer any questions.

00:18:03.600 --> 00:18:04.810
Me! Me! Me!

00:18:04.810 --> 00:18:06.690
What's your favorite food?

00:18:06.690 --> 00:18:09.020
Do you squeeze lemons
over fried chicken?

00:18:09.020 --> 00:18:10.940
Uhm... Uhm...

00:18:10.940 --> 00:18:13.230
Do you like mushrooms
or bamboo shoots?

00:18:13.230 --> 00:18:15.280
Do you pour condensed milk
over strawberries?

00:18:15.280 --> 00:18:16.400
Uhm... Uhm...

00:18:19.870 --> 00:18:22.820
Next, Machi will sing!

00:18:19.870 --> 00:18:22.910
Next, Machi-chan will sing!

00:18:32.960 --> 00:18:33.840
The other day

00:18:33.840 --> 00:18:34.960
The other day!

00:18:34.960 --> 00:18:35.920
I meet a bear

00:18:35.920 --> 00:18:37.010
I meet a bear!

00:18:37.010 --> 00:18:37.880
A great big bear

00:18:37.880 --> 00:18:38.970
A great big bear!

00:18:38.970 --> 00:18:39.930
Oh way out there

00:18:39.930 --> 00:18:40.970
Oh way out there!

00:18:40.970 --> 00:18:44.470
Upon the forest path so fair

00:18:41.890 --> 00:18:43.470
Hey, bear!

00:18:43.470 --> 00:18:45.600
Don't come closer!

00:18:44.810 --> 00:18:48.390
I met a very nice old bear

00:18:45.600 --> 00:18:47.520
Beast! Beast!

00:18:47.520 --> 00:18:48.390
Watch out!

00:18:48.270 --> 00:18:49.370
Machi!

00:18:48.270 --> 00:18:49.370
Machi-chan!

00:18:49.480 --> 00:18:53.690
Hey! Yeah! Hey! Yeah! Hey! Yeah! Hey! Yeah!

00:18:55.320 --> 00:18:56.030
Okay!

00:18:56.030 --> 00:18:58.110
Thank you very much!

00:18:59.490 --> 00:19:02.060
Good job, Machi.

00:18:59.490 --> 00:19:02.200
Good job, Machi-chan.

00:19:03.780 --> 00:19:04.580
I'm scared...

00:19:05.040 --> 00:19:06.660
Men are scary...

00:19:07.200 --> 00:19:08.500
They're loud...

00:19:08.500 --> 00:19:09.250
Hm?

00:19:09.250 --> 00:19:10.540
Really?

00:19:10.540 --> 00:19:12.330
They move violently, too.

00:19:12.330 --> 00:19:13.130
I'm scared!

00:19:14.170 --> 00:19:15.630
Hey, hey, hey!

00:19:15.630 --> 00:19:16.960
What the hell is this?

00:19:18.340 --> 00:19:20.590
"Nice old bear," my ass!

00:19:20.590 --> 00:19:22.720
Bears are harmful animals!

00:19:23.300 --> 00:19:26.350
This is the problem with
Kumade Village people.

00:19:26.890 --> 00:19:28.930
Th-They're from Tamura Village!

00:19:28.930 --> 00:19:33.310
They try to pick a fight with us
every chance they get!

00:19:33.310 --> 00:19:35.270
The singing was terrible, too.

00:19:35.690 --> 00:19:38.030
l can sing 100 times better.

00:19:38.360 --> 00:19:40.280
Give me the microphone! Now!

00:19:40.280 --> 00:19:41.070
Huh?!

00:19:41.070 --> 00:19:42.530
What's your problem, pops?!

00:19:42.530 --> 00:19:44.240
Hey, hey, hey...!

00:19:44.240 --> 00:19:46.280
Please don't cause trouble!

00:19:46.280 --> 00:19:48.040
What?! Who're you?

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:50.910
We do have permission, you know.

00:19:50.910 --> 00:19:51.540
Huh?!

00:19:51.540 --> 00:19:55.380
Even if the Agricultural Cooperatives
gave you permission, we won't approve it!

00:19:59.630 --> 00:20:02.630
Kumade Village is...

00:20:03.550 --> 00:20:08.350
...cursed!

00:20:09.140 --> 00:20:10.640
That's old hag Tamura!

00:20:11.140 --> 00:20:12.980
Old hag Tamura is here!

00:20:13.810 --> 00:20:17.440
Don't go near Kumade Village!

00:20:18.530 --> 00:20:23.240
It's haunted by beasts!

00:20:29.580 --> 00:20:31.790
O-Our village is haunted, you say?!

00:20:32.210 --> 00:20:34.290
The old hag is right, right?

00:20:34.290 --> 00:20:36.170
Don't say such an ominous thing!

00:20:36.170 --> 00:20:37.340
That's right!

00:20:37.340 --> 00:20:40.420
Our village is more religious
than anywhere else!

00:20:40.420 --> 00:20:42.380
There's no way that we're cursed!

00:20:42.380 --> 00:20:44.470
The Tamura Village people should go home!

00:20:44.470 --> 00:20:46.140
Kumade Village is stupid!

00:20:46.140 --> 00:20:47.470
Your vegetables taste bad, too!

00:20:47.470 --> 00:20:50.100
You'd better clean up after your dogs!

00:20:50.100 --> 00:20:52.180
<i>Your</i> vegetables taste bad!

00:20:52.180 --> 00:20:54.140
Tamura people are rude and grouchy!

00:20:54.600 --> 00:20:56.900
Buses don't even stop
at your village, do they?!

00:20:57.310 --> 00:20:59.820
Do something about your
illegal dumping of tires!

00:21:00.570 --> 00:21:02.690
You damn hicks don't even
have a convenience store!

00:21:03.490 --> 00:21:05.360
Both sound like hicks.

00:21:06.070 --> 00:21:07.490
Your village is full of deserted houses!

00:21:07.490 --> 00:21:09.120
Your woodland path is in terrible shape!

00:21:09.120 --> 00:21:10.990
Your village is a proposed site for a dam!

00:21:10.990 --> 00:21:12.950
Your roads get closed during the winter!

00:21:12.950 --> 00:21:14.620
You're not on the map!

00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:23.260
Well, now that we're all united...

00:21:23.840 --> 00:21:30.430
Let's work further together to liven up
Kumade Village revitalization projects!

00:21:31.310 --> 00:21:33.930
Is it really going to work...?

00:21:34.310 --> 00:21:36.560
Well then, we have to get
to the next event, so...

00:21:37.190 --> 00:21:41.190
Our village is fated to die out...

00:21:43.650 --> 00:21:44.440
Huh?

00:21:46.150 --> 00:21:47.200
Let's go home.

00:21:52.990 --> 00:21:53.790
Why am I...

00:21:54.290 --> 00:21:56.000
...performing as an idol?!

00:23:28.420 --> 00:23:29.550
Kumamiko-chan!

00:23:31.510 --> 00:23:33.050
I'm hungry.

00:23:34.800 --> 00:23:37.060
Why don't you bear it until dinner?

00:23:44.980 --> 00:23:48.780
She's pleading that she's hungry
just with her mouth movements!

00:23:50.360 --> 00:23:54.200
Kumamiko.
